{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中環發生傷人案。今日（15日）凌晨3時許，一名男子在皇后大道中29號對開位置報案，表示其年約20歲男性友人臉部有鎅傷傷口，男傷者清醒由救護車送往瑪麗醫院接受治理。</p><p>就現場所見，警方到場跟進，正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198496223343022080149870.jpeg/yEBhitU9bByJFa52qIKuHsNYAhqoEiKpzx7ePPUe3jw\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為皇后大道中29號。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198496220054556672943028.jpeg/wFGHpF-DjGMHb9fwyKRdjnOm1s0gZTyJd2mns01pp7M\"/><figcaption>現場為皇后大道中29號。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T21:10:45.485765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:44:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T21:44:38.821550+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T21:04:09.185335+00:00","content_hash":"f86c2b5378f61f5c0735fc8d38dd74e3dcfb0e34477c55aecd972bbe878fd5e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}